%% Inference and grading are separate halves - that seam lets Aiden swap harnesses freely.
sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Task dir
    participant A as Aiden
    participant E as Sandbox
    participant O as Grader
    A->>T: fetch problem_statement only
    Note over T: gold patch and tests stay out of the agent's filesystem
    A->>E: run at base_commit, egress off
    E-->>A: cwd state
    Note over A,E: step/cost limits trip -> auto-report, never silent
    A->>O: preds.jsonl = model_patch
    A->>O: traj.json = cost, turns, harness_version, state_hash
    O->>E: reset, apply model_patch, apply test_patch
    O->>O: run SELECTED tests (F2P + P2P)
    O-->>T: resolved = all F2P pass AND all P2P pass
    Note over O: paired vs baseline, 3 seeds.<br/>under 3pp is NOISE
